"                        (antiseptics) or symptom control (anti-"
"inflammatories), emerging science indicates that\n"
"                        long-term oral health depends on precise microbiome "
"modulation. Lacer aims to establish\n"
"                        leadership in microbiome-based oral care by "
"integrating this science into next-generation\n"
"                        products, enabling new differentiated claims such as "
"reversing early-stage gingivitis by\n"
"                        targeting underlying imbalances."
msgstr ""
"Trong khi hiện phương pháp điều trị bệnh viêm lợi chủ yếu dựa trên rộng vi "
